{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pulls/93","id":4896033592,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVLzC488AAAABI9OLOA","html_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pull/93","diff_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pull/93.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pull/93.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/issues/93","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pulls/93/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pulls/93/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/issues/93/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/statuses/ecdd6275b4ce4c100a41a5632920a01fb5937c65","number":93,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"A00→A05: pinned reproducible real QueryAbi QEMU replay atop hardened owner guest","user":{"login":"Franksudoman","id":273670192,"node_id":"U_kgDOEE_gMA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/273670192?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman","html_url":"https://github.com/Franksudoman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"A00→A05 additive test-only handoff stacked on [PR #90](https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pull/90) with A05's real native QEMU evidence from [#91](https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pull/91). Exactly **3 A05-owned `tests/kernel/control/**` files**; no kernel, wire ABI, Hepta or README modifications.\n\n**Real deliverable:** `run_queryabi_guest.py` uses the project's existing A01 in-memory bounded `newc` pack/unpack helpers to replay the **real read-only QueryAbi C probe** in pinned QEMU without unpacking anything to the host. It SHA-verifies caller-supplied actual kernel ELF, fixed upstream A01 initrd `86be65ab9234cd20ea6ec8d44a12b8765fd7a3e241fde920c71b3621ca0047f3`, fixed SeaBIOS `1a9ea4f17bcfb27bda5728e2c21d9fa074cf7947b9b4910bb28213a735c96735`, and repository Asterinas/nightly/Hepta pins. It compiles the *current* A05 `queryabi_guest.c` with strict C11 static cc, injects exactly once before the fixed A01 boot marker into a reproducible `gzip(mtime=0)` guest initramfs and runs 1vCPU/512MiB QEMU q35 TCG with no network or data disk. Bounded 45s default, 1..120s allowed; success requires raw QEMU exit 33, A01 boot and hardened HOS2 QueryAbi markers with no panic/fail. Logs and result.json are written only to a new 0700 directory, never production system disks or host cgroups.\n\n**CPU-only tests:** `test_queryabi_guest_runner.py` defines 5 synthetic archive/injection regressions (once-only placement, deterministic bytes, missing/duplicated marker, non-strict init refusal, bad archive/oversized probe, duplicate guest entry). Existing `run-host-smoke.sh` now mandates both runner and test file and runs normal `python3 -I` and optimized `-I -O` unittest, along with #90's strict C guest HOSR negative contract.\n\n**Honest execution:** source and Git blob checks completed; *these new Python tests and actual QEMU replay have not been executed in this A00 environment*. Wait for exact-head G0 host-contracts, then A05 owner should run the reproducible script on the originally built kernel in the authorized QEMU cloud, retain serial logs, and post exact source/input SHA results. A previous guest result from A05 #91 is valid for its earlier test binary, **not** automatic acceptance of this hardened test. No full CapSpace, five HOS2 operations, CPU effects, Hepta durable K↔D, GPU or production hardware sign-off.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-17T01:00:24Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T01:06:18Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"49fd930c1932176984d559688747e7f7cbf5e095","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"TrillionniumFoundation:agents/A00-a05-queryabi-native-replay","ref":"agents/A00-a05-queryabi-native-replay","repo":{"id":1421656803,"node_id":"R_kgDOVLzC4w","name":"trillionnium-os-desktop","full_name":"TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop","owner":{"login":"TrillionniumFoundation","id":262513357,"node_id":"O_kgDOD6WizQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262513357?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrillionniumFoundation","html_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrillionniumFoundation/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrillionniumFoundation/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrillionniumFoundation/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrillionniumFoundation/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrillionniumFoundation/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Trillionni